1
00:00:00,440 --> 00:00:02,170
(All people, incidents,
and backgrounds...)

2
00:00:02,240 --> 00:00:03,440
(in this drama are fictitious
and unrelated to reality.)

3
00:00:03,510 --> 00:00:05,310
(Also, children were filmed
under production guidelines.)

4
00:00:06,310 --> 00:00:07,450
We're from the Prosecutors' Office.

5
00:00:09,180 --> 00:00:10,880
We're here to execute
a search and seizure warrant.

6
00:00:11,050 --> 00:00:12,720
A search and seizure?

7
00:00:13,350 --> 00:00:14,590
This is regarding
a violation of the Act...

8
00:00:14,650 --> 00:00:16,250
on the Aggravated Punishment
of Specific Economic Crimes...

9
00:00:16,490 --> 00:00:18,220
and charges of bribery.

10
00:00:21,630 --> 00:00:24,160
So this is about the slush fund?

11
00:00:24,330 --> 00:00:25,630
Yes, we've already
secured the ledger.

12
00:00:25,700 --> 00:00:28,000
So please cooperate.
All right, let's begin!

13
00:00:28,070 --> 00:00:30,170
What? Hey, where are you going?

14
00:00:30,270 --> 00:00:33,070
Where do you think you're going?
Look here.

15
00:00:33,140 --> 00:00:35,710
Cut this out right now!

16
00:00:37,680 --> 00:00:39,340
What?

17
00:00:40,750 --> 00:00:42,910
These punks... Hey!

18
00:00:44,780 --> 00:00:45,850
Darn them.

19
00:00:49,850 --> 00:00:51,360
Hyun Jun, hey!

20
00:00:51,860 --> 00:00:54,690
What on earth just happened?

21
00:00:55,690 --> 00:00:57,360
Park Min Jun tricked us.

22
00:00:58,400 --> 00:01:00,870
He got someone else to hand
the ledger over to the prosecution.

23
00:01:01,700 --> 00:01:04,800
I think him trying to run
was just to buy time.

24
00:01:05,570 --> 00:01:06,940
Park Min Jun...

25
00:01:07,310 --> 00:01:09,070
Then what's going to happen now?

26
00:01:10,070 --> 00:01:11,480
What about the company?

27
00:01:21,120 --> 00:01:22,720
(Adele)

28
00:01:23,720 --> 00:01:24,720
Begin.

29
00:01:49,380 --> 00:01:53,450
(Prosecution Service)

30
00:02:02,460 --> 00:02:04,860
What's really going to happen
to the company?

31
00:02:05,130 --> 00:02:07,830
Tell me about it.
A slush fund, of all things?

32
00:02:07,900 --> 00:02:08,900
Unbelievable.

33
00:02:16,240 --> 00:02:18,010
What on earth?

34
00:02:24,020 --> 00:02:26,380
Kim Dan Hui, Park Min Jun.

35
00:02:26,750 --> 00:02:30,520
You stole the slush fund ledger
and gave it to the prosecution?

36
00:02:30,860 --> 00:02:33,220
Yes, that's exactly what I did.

37
00:02:33,790 --> 00:02:36,730
You've probably already received
a summons from the prosecution.

38
00:02:36,830 --> 00:02:40,160
And your powerful backers
in politics and business?

39
00:02:41,170 --> 00:02:43,770
Assemblyman Kwon is already
being investigated.

40
00:02:43,870 --> 00:02:45,600
Everyone else will be trying
to save their own skin,

41
00:02:45,800 --> 00:02:47,710
so they'll be busy
cutting ties with you.

42
00:02:48,570 --> 00:02:50,170
You'd better not expect anything
from them.

43
00:02:51,640 --> 00:02:52,980
There's nothing...

44
00:02:53,040 --> 00:02:54,850
you can use anymore.

45
00:02:55,350 --> 00:02:58,050
That dirty money that protected you,

46
00:02:58,120 --> 00:02:59,150
and the power you had,

47
00:02:59,620 --> 00:03:01,520
are all gone.

48
00:03:05,820 --> 00:03:08,060
You dirty rats. Darn you!

49
00:03:10,160 --> 00:03:11,560
That's enough.

50
00:03:11,630 --> 00:03:13,670
Do you want to add assault charges?

51
00:03:13,670 --> 00:03:15,830
What? Assault?

52
00:03:16,300 --> 00:03:17,670
You brat!

53
00:03:20,000 --> 00:03:21,170
Min Jun!

54
00:03:25,640 --> 00:03:27,110
What do you think you're doing?

55
00:03:27,180 --> 00:03:31,150
My own son deceives me
and steals the ledger?

56
00:03:31,450 --> 00:03:34,120
And to think I favored you
for being the eldest son.

57
00:03:34,920 --> 00:03:37,890
Just like your mother 30 years ago,

58
00:03:37,960 --> 00:03:39,760
you should have died.

59
00:03:39,760 --> 00:03:40,860
Shut it!

60
00:03:43,460 --> 00:03:45,360
You're the one who should've died.

61
00:03:45,960 --> 00:03:47,070
Someday,

62
00:03:47,930 --> 00:03:50,130
you'll definitely regret
what happened today.

63
00:03:50,200 --> 00:03:53,040
I'll regret this?

64
00:03:53,540 --> 00:03:56,770
Do you really think I, Park Tae Ho,
would be taken down...

65
00:03:56,870 --> 00:03:58,740
by a bunch of pathetic cops
and prosecutors?

66
00:03:58,980 --> 00:04:00,710
Don't be ridiculous...

67
00:04:06,120 --> 00:04:07,220
Father!

68
00:04:07,320 --> 00:04:08,690
- Honey.
- Father.

69
00:04:08,790 --> 00:04:10,920
- Honey!
- Father.

70
00:04:11,020 --> 00:04:12,020
Honey.

71
00:04:12,320 --> 00:04:13,390
Father?

72
00:04:20,800 --> 00:04:23,270
Okay, I understand.
We'll talk about it.

73
00:04:25,740 --> 00:04:27,340
James looked into it,

74
00:04:27,410 --> 00:04:29,240
and it appears the prosecution
will delay issuing...

75
00:04:29,310 --> 00:04:30,440
the summons for questioning.

76
00:04:30,610 --> 00:04:32,410
Apparently, Park Tae Ho
cited health reasons...

77
00:04:32,480 --> 00:04:34,580
and asked them to reschedule.

78
00:04:35,980 --> 00:04:37,480
Health issues?

79
00:04:39,420 --> 00:04:40,920
He could be lying.

80
00:04:41,550 --> 00:04:43,920
To avoid the summons
for questioning,

81
00:04:43,990 --> 00:04:45,620
he pretended to be sick?

82
00:04:46,360 --> 00:04:48,890
Knowing Park Tae Ho,
that's entirely possible.

83
00:05:07,650 --> 00:05:08,710
Get up already.

84
00:05:10,080 --> 00:05:12,050
You're quite an actor.

85
00:05:12,250 --> 00:05:13,950
I can't believe you faked
passing out back there.

86
00:05:14,020 --> 00:05:18,560
Darn it. I mean, just darn.

87
00:05:18,720 --> 00:05:19,720
Look.

88
00:05:20,360 --> 00:05:22,830
Don't you see this summons?

89
00:05:22,960 --> 00:05:25,600
I had to do this to buy some time.

90
00:05:25,660 --> 00:05:28,500
How else am I supposed
to come up with a plan?

91
00:05:28,630 --> 00:05:29,970
What kind of plan?

92
00:05:30,200 --> 00:05:32,900
To run away overseas
and avoid the investigation?

93
00:05:33,440 --> 00:05:35,740
Do you take me, Park Tae Ho,

94
00:05:36,510 --> 00:05:39,240
for a man who runs and hides?

95
00:05:40,080 --> 00:05:44,080
Did you ask the prosecutors' office
to reschedule my summons?

96
00:05:44,320 --> 00:05:47,220
Yes, and it seems
they're willing to reschedule.

97
00:05:47,290 --> 00:05:49,950
Good.
Now that we've bought some time,

98
00:05:50,150 --> 00:05:54,330
contact the top law firm immediately
and assemble a legal team.

99
00:05:54,960 --> 00:05:59,100
Tell them to report back
on our preparation for questioning.

100
00:06:00,530 --> 00:06:01,630
That...

101
00:06:01,800 --> 00:06:02,830
I'll do it.

102
00:06:03,700 --> 00:06:04,700
You, Mom?

103
00:06:05,200 --> 00:06:08,040
If we need to squeeze a plan
out of those lawyers,

104
00:06:08,640 --> 00:06:10,370
I'm much better at it than you are.

105
00:06:10,370 --> 00:06:11,610
Sure.

106
00:06:11,610 --> 00:06:15,980
We don't have a lot of time.
Tell them to bring me a plan, fast.

107
00:06:17,620 --> 00:06:19,580
If there's no avoiding
the investigation,

108
00:06:20,080 --> 00:06:21,620
I'll prepare for everything...

109
00:06:22,920 --> 00:06:24,620
and push through.

110
00:06:25,290 --> 00:06:27,360
Of course. Absolutely.

111
00:06:37,400 --> 00:06:41,010
Right. We can't give Park Tae Ho
any room for excuses or extra time.

112
00:06:42,170 --> 00:06:45,240
I'll double-check if there's really
an issue with his health.

113
00:06:45,680 --> 00:06:48,780
I need to find a way to move up
the summons for questioning.

114
00:06:48,850 --> 00:06:51,420
Wait, how about this?

115
00:06:52,620 --> 00:06:53,620
What's that?

116
00:07:02,490 --> 00:07:04,700
You need to stay out of this.

117
00:07:05,560 --> 00:07:06,560
What?

118
00:07:07,000 --> 00:07:09,500
You have nothing to do
with the slush fund,

119
00:07:09,570 --> 00:07:11,940
so there's no need to get involved
and be dragged down.

120
00:07:12,140 --> 00:07:14,810
I'll get the lawyers
and handle the preparations,

121
00:07:15,070 --> 00:07:16,470
so you just focus on the company.

122
00:07:17,380 --> 00:07:19,210
You're after something else,
aren't you?

123
00:07:22,150 --> 00:07:23,710
We're facing a crisis here.

124
00:07:24,180 --> 00:07:25,980
Don't go causing trouble
by acting alone,

125
00:07:26,780 --> 00:07:27,790
and let me help you.

126
00:07:29,520 --> 00:07:32,520
Park Tae Ho will have a hard time
getting out of this.

127
00:07:33,120 --> 00:07:34,160
Honestly,

128
00:07:34,260 --> 00:07:36,430
why go to the trouble
of getting him out?

129
00:07:36,490 --> 00:07:38,160
You're the chairman now, after all.

130
00:07:39,100 --> 00:07:42,830
We'll use this chance
to take over his stocks and assets.

131
00:07:43,130 --> 00:07:44,700
That's enough.

132
00:07:48,010 --> 00:07:50,370
What are you trying to do now?

133
00:07:50,580 --> 00:07:54,010
You framed Baek Jin Ju
just to take the chairman's seat,

134
00:07:54,080 --> 00:07:57,750
and now you're after Chairman Park's
shares and entire fortune?

135
00:07:58,350 --> 00:08:00,450
Why are you suddenly
taking his side?

136
00:08:00,550 --> 00:08:04,560
I'm not taking his side.
It's Hyun Jun I'm worried about.

137
00:08:05,690 --> 00:08:07,660
Stop trying to steal from others...

138
00:08:07,760 --> 00:08:09,260
and think about our Hyun Jun.

139
00:08:11,300 --> 00:08:15,130
Help him get back
what he's lost first.

140
00:08:15,170 --> 00:08:17,240
What exactly has he lost?

141
00:08:17,340 --> 00:08:18,670
He's the chairman now,

142
00:08:18,740 --> 00:08:20,500
and I got rid of everyone
in his way.

143
00:08:20,570 --> 00:08:21,910
So what's the problem?

144
00:08:21,940 --> 00:08:22,940
Exactly.

145
00:08:24,940 --> 00:08:27,180
I'm beginning to think
that you're the real problem here.

146
00:08:33,280 --> 00:08:36,620
Excessive greed will lead
to your downfall.

147
00:08:36,620 --> 00:08:37,720
Besides,

148
00:08:37,990 --> 00:08:40,790
the fight between both sides
is getting worse.

149
00:08:40,860 --> 00:08:45,130
Why do you keep pushing
our Hyun Jun into the deep end?

150
00:08:45,130 --> 00:08:46,530
What deep end?

151
00:08:47,370 --> 00:08:49,670
Once we secure
Park Tae Ho's stocks and assets,

152
00:08:49,730 --> 00:08:50,970
even if his secret gets out,

153
00:08:51,040 --> 00:08:53,570
he can keep the chairmanship
and live comfortably.

154
00:08:53,570 --> 00:08:56,510
Hyun Jun knows all of that,
which is why he wants it all, too.

155
00:08:57,310 --> 00:08:59,410
So don't needlessly interfere
and get in the way.

156
00:09:20,400 --> 00:09:22,400
I may have lost
the slush fund ledger,

157
00:09:23,670 --> 00:09:24,900
but the stocks and assets...

158
00:09:26,100 --> 00:09:27,470
must belong to me.

159
00:09:38,120 --> 00:09:40,690
What?
Do you have something else to say?

160
00:09:41,420 --> 00:09:42,420
I get it.

161
00:09:42,750 --> 00:09:44,320
Are you spying on me
hoping to find out...

162
00:09:44,590 --> 00:09:45,760
about Father's condition?

163
00:09:46,920 --> 00:09:51,260
Yes, and seeing you here
confirms it.

164
00:09:52,260 --> 00:09:54,470
Him passing out was an act,
wasn't it?

165
00:09:54,700 --> 00:09:57,540
A ploy to buy time
before the summons for questioning.

166
00:09:57,600 --> 00:09:58,600
Well...

167
00:09:59,670 --> 00:10:01,270
Think what you want.

168
00:10:01,810 --> 00:10:05,840
Whatever your plan is,
it won't go your way.

169
00:10:05,980 --> 00:10:07,110
Park Tae Ho...

170
00:10:07,510 --> 00:10:10,110
There's no escaping the law
this time.

171
00:10:10,410 --> 00:10:11,450
Fine.

172
00:10:15,250 --> 00:10:17,120
See how far you can push this.

173
00:10:17,860 --> 00:10:19,160
Whether Chairman Park Tae Ho...

174
00:10:19,760 --> 00:10:21,690
ends up dragged off
by the prosecution or not,

175
00:10:22,960 --> 00:10:24,100
I'd like to see that for myself.

176
00:10:36,070 --> 00:10:39,280
A prosecutorial summons
for questioning?

177
00:10:40,040 --> 00:10:41,980
We turned over
the slush fund ledger,

178
00:10:42,310 --> 00:10:44,180
so no matter
how much Park Tae Ho tries to stall,

179
00:10:44,650 --> 00:10:46,480
he can't escape the investigation.

180
00:10:46,880 --> 00:10:50,490
Naturally, Manager Kang, you,
who helped create the slush fund,

181
00:10:51,220 --> 00:10:54,490
and I, who was briefly involved,

182
00:10:54,660 --> 00:10:55,860
will face punishment too.

183
00:10:58,600 --> 00:10:59,630
But...

184
00:10:59,700 --> 00:11:02,400
if you come forward, confess,
and cooperate with the investigation,

185
00:11:02,470 --> 00:11:03,930
you could get a lighter sentence.

186
00:11:05,270 --> 00:11:07,170
Please testify about
everything you did...

187
00:11:07,670 --> 00:11:09,010
for Park Tae Ho.

188
00:11:17,150 --> 00:11:19,150
What? Say that again.

189
00:11:19,750 --> 00:11:21,620
You want me to sign
my stocks and assets...

190
00:11:22,950 --> 00:11:24,520
over to Hyun Jun?

191
00:11:25,290 --> 00:11:26,290
Yes.

192
00:11:26,690 --> 00:11:28,860
I spoke with the lawyers,

193
00:11:29,160 --> 00:11:30,660
and the evidence
in the slush fund ledger...

194
00:11:30,730 --> 00:11:31,730
is just too strong.

195
00:11:32,300 --> 00:11:34,170
You'll be arrested
as soon as the investigation starts.

196
00:11:34,530 --> 00:11:36,930
The stocks and assets
under your name...

197
00:11:37,540 --> 00:11:39,700
will likely be investigated too.

198
00:11:40,170 --> 00:11:42,010
They said transferring them
to Hyun Jun...

199
00:11:42,070 --> 00:11:44,380
is the only way to protect
the management rights.

200
00:11:45,740 --> 00:11:47,780
Protect the management rights?

201
00:11:47,880 --> 00:11:49,610
If your stocks are frozen,

202
00:11:49,710 --> 00:11:51,680
do you think Kim Dan Hui
and Moon Tae Jin will just stand by?

203
00:11:51,780 --> 00:11:54,350
They'll immediately demand
a new chairman election.

204
00:11:54,420 --> 00:11:55,990
We need your stocks...

205
00:11:56,050 --> 00:11:59,090
to protect our Hyun Jun
and Adele Group.

206
00:12:06,800 --> 00:12:08,670
Darn it.

207
00:12:09,530 --> 00:12:11,800
Rather than letting them
take over Adele Group,

208
00:12:12,040 --> 00:12:14,170
it's safer to transfer your shares
and wealth to Hyun Jun...

209
00:12:14,240 --> 00:12:15,870
to protect the company.

210
00:12:16,040 --> 00:12:18,640
Do you agree with her?

211
00:12:20,640 --> 00:12:23,310
I suppose that's why
you drew up this contract...

212
00:12:23,650 --> 00:12:25,080
and brought it here.

213
00:12:27,990 --> 00:12:28,990
- Yes, sir.
- Yes, sir.

214
00:12:29,050 --> 00:12:33,060
Why you... You imbeciles!

215
00:12:33,490 --> 00:12:34,990
This is unbelievable.

216
00:12:36,590 --> 00:12:39,060
How dare you conspire
behind my back?

217
00:12:39,960 --> 00:12:41,930
What are you talking about?

218
00:12:42,000 --> 00:12:44,100
I told you to prepare
for the investigation,

219
00:12:44,340 --> 00:12:47,370
not scheme to steal my shares.

220
00:12:47,670 --> 00:12:50,510
And you call yourselves lawyers?

221
00:12:50,880 --> 00:12:53,010
Get out. Get out right now!

222
00:12:57,780 --> 00:12:59,850
Hey, you. Get over here.

223
00:13:00,750 --> 00:13:01,920
Of course.

224
00:13:02,290 --> 00:13:05,120
I knew something was off
when you offered...

225
00:13:05,120 --> 00:13:07,060
to talk to the lawyers.

226
00:13:07,120 --> 00:13:10,160
Unbelievable.
You never planned on helping me.

227
00:13:10,960 --> 00:13:12,860
You were just plotting to rob me.

228
00:13:13,360 --> 00:13:15,600
Word is you're finished this time.

229
00:13:15,700 --> 00:13:17,800
So I need to at least
look out for Hyun Jun.

230
00:13:18,900 --> 00:13:20,300
You'd hate to lose Adele Group,

231
00:13:20,300 --> 00:13:22,370
which you cherish more
than life itself.

232
00:13:22,470 --> 00:13:24,340
- Why, you...
- Father!

233
00:13:25,640 --> 00:13:26,840
The summons for questioning...

234
00:13:28,010 --> 00:13:29,750
It's happening tomorrow.

235
00:13:30,350 --> 00:13:31,920
Wait, what?

236
00:13:32,520 --> 00:13:33,720
But why?

237
00:13:44,260 --> 00:13:46,800
Under orders
from Chairman Park Tae Ho,

238
00:13:47,160 --> 00:13:50,830
Manager Kang and I helped manage
the slush fund.

239
00:13:53,170 --> 00:13:56,510
Please arrange a cross-examination
with Park Tae Ho at once.

240
00:13:57,910 --> 00:14:00,740
With such a key informant
and witness coming forward,

241
00:14:00,950 --> 00:14:01,980
don't you have...

242
00:14:02,680 --> 00:14:04,980
more than enough grounds
to summon Park Tae Ho?

243
00:14:07,280 --> 00:14:11,760
What? Kim Dan Hui,
and even Manager Kang?

244
00:14:11,820 --> 00:14:12,860
See?

245
00:14:13,320 --> 00:14:15,790
The prosecution is armed
with the ledger and witnesses.

246
00:14:15,790 --> 00:14:17,160
If the investigation
starts tomorrow,

247
00:14:17,260 --> 00:14:18,560
you'll lose everything.

248
00:14:18,560 --> 00:14:19,960
Will you be quiet?

249
00:14:20,160 --> 00:14:22,900
Have you forgotten what happened
because you held on to everything?

250
00:14:23,400 --> 00:14:25,670
Had you entrusted your slush fund
to Hyun Jun or me,

251
00:14:25,670 --> 00:14:27,140
you wouldn't be in this position.

252
00:14:28,040 --> 00:14:29,770
Because you couldn't trust anyone,

253
00:14:29,840 --> 00:14:31,540
Kim Dan Hui took everything
from you.

254
00:14:31,810 --> 00:14:33,210
Are you really going to hoard...

255
00:14:33,280 --> 00:14:35,050
your shares and assets
until you lose those, too?

256
00:14:35,910 --> 00:14:38,550
If you do, you'll end up losing
the entire Adele Group.

257
00:14:41,150 --> 00:14:42,150
Still...

258
00:14:44,390 --> 00:14:48,030
Not my shares and assets.

259
00:14:49,990 --> 00:14:51,030
Father.

260
00:14:51,660 --> 00:14:54,030
Please,
look at the situation rationally.

261
00:14:54,800 --> 00:14:57,170
The summons for questioning
is tomorrow.

262
00:14:57,500 --> 00:14:59,600
Between the slush fund ledger
and Manager Kang,

263
00:14:59,670 --> 00:15:01,740
the evidence and testimony
are airtight.

264
00:15:02,170 --> 00:15:04,580
Once your shares and assets
are frozen,

265
00:15:05,440 --> 00:15:06,940
I can't protect Adele Group,

266
00:15:08,150 --> 00:15:09,810
nor can I protect you.

267
00:15:13,250 --> 00:15:14,650
You, protecting me?

268
00:15:14,950 --> 00:15:16,690
The investigation and trial
will take years.

269
00:15:16,750 --> 00:15:18,260
What do you think you can do
on your own?

270
00:15:19,390 --> 00:15:21,490
You need someone on the outside...

271
00:15:21,660 --> 00:15:23,730
to manage the lawyers
and support you.

272
00:15:25,100 --> 00:15:28,630
If I hand over all my shares
and assets...

273
00:15:30,770 --> 00:15:32,470
You could betray me.

274
00:15:35,240 --> 00:15:37,340
If you can't trust me,

275
00:15:38,740 --> 00:15:41,110
then I'll step down as chairman...

276
00:15:43,050 --> 00:15:44,210
of Adele Group.

277
00:15:46,080 --> 00:15:47,120
Park Hyun Jun!

278
00:15:47,120 --> 00:15:48,250
After all,

279
00:15:49,620 --> 00:15:52,060
without Father's shares and assets,
I'll get kicked out anyway.

280
00:15:52,060 --> 00:15:53,520
It's better to give up now.

281
00:15:56,790 --> 00:16:00,230
Your son or your stocks.

282
00:16:01,630 --> 00:16:03,400
Choose which of the two...

283
00:16:04,640 --> 00:16:05,800
you're going to keep.

284
00:16:15,780 --> 00:16:19,080
- Here you go.
- Drink up. It's nice and cold.

285
00:16:19,780 --> 00:16:22,390
All that's left now is for you
to get your sweet victory.

286
00:16:22,520 --> 00:16:25,390
Oh, thank you. I'll enjoy it.

287
00:16:25,790 --> 00:16:28,030
Boss, you're on closing duty today.

288
00:16:28,230 --> 00:16:29,860
All right. Go on home.

289
00:16:31,560 --> 00:16:33,330
Okay, I'm heading out then.

290
00:16:33,600 --> 00:16:35,470
- Enjoy.
- You have to leave the tray.

291
00:16:36,270 --> 00:16:38,300
- See you.
- I thought she was taking it.

292
00:16:40,440 --> 00:16:41,640
I bet the questioning was tough.

293
00:16:41,640 --> 00:16:44,480
Not really.
They just confirmed a few things.

294
00:16:44,780 --> 00:16:47,750
When Park Tae Ho is summoned,
I'll be questioned further.

295
00:16:47,810 --> 00:16:50,310
Manager Kang is the one
getting grilled right now.

296
00:16:50,510 --> 00:16:53,450
He's been by Park Tae Ho's side
doing his dirty work for years.

297
00:16:54,150 --> 00:16:55,420
Manager Kang...

298
00:16:55,620 --> 00:16:59,520
Turns out watching his whereabouts
was a great call.

299
00:16:59,790 --> 00:17:03,290
Jin Ju persuading him that he could
receive a reduced sentence was key.

300
00:17:03,360 --> 00:17:07,260
Since you were watching over
his mother's new nursing home,

301
00:17:07,260 --> 00:17:10,600
he must've figured he could
at least trust you, Dan Hui.

302
00:17:10,670 --> 00:17:13,170
I guess a lot of things
just fell into place.

303
00:17:14,410 --> 00:17:15,410
Right, and thanks to their efforts,

304
00:17:15,410 --> 00:17:17,740
Park Tae Ho was immediately issued
a summons for questioning.

305
00:17:18,240 --> 00:17:19,780
You did great, Mother.

306
00:17:21,040 --> 00:17:22,950
But where's Jin Ju?

307
00:17:22,950 --> 00:17:24,310
She went to see Choi Yu Na.

308
00:17:25,220 --> 00:17:26,820
- Choi Yu Na?
- Yes.

309
00:17:27,220 --> 00:17:28,750
To inform her about Park Tae Ho...

310
00:17:28,820 --> 00:17:32,160
and push her to testify
about the incident seven years ago.

311
00:17:32,320 --> 00:17:34,020
Once the slush fund investigation
is underway,

312
00:17:34,090 --> 00:17:36,290
it'll connect to the case
from seven years ago.

313
00:17:36,530 --> 00:17:38,760
Securing testimony
from Park Tae Ho's accomplice...

314
00:17:38,900 --> 00:17:40,800
will give the investigation
a huge boost.

315
00:17:41,000 --> 00:17:43,530
Yes. And regarding Deputy Chief Yun,

316
00:17:44,030 --> 00:17:46,200
Choi Yu Na must
be held accountable as well.

317
00:17:54,140 --> 00:17:55,450
What happened?

318
00:17:55,510 --> 00:17:57,410
Will Oh Jung Ran get me out of here?

319
00:17:58,250 --> 00:17:59,420
Get you out?

320
00:17:59,680 --> 00:18:01,450
She didn't even bat an eye.

321
00:18:02,050 --> 00:18:03,490
She said if you run your mouth,

322
00:18:03,490 --> 00:18:05,960
you'll be charged with murder,
not attempted murder.

323
00:18:06,090 --> 00:18:07,760
I was the one being threatened.

324
00:18:08,660 --> 00:18:09,660
What?

325
00:18:10,660 --> 00:18:12,000
That's ridiculous.

326
00:18:12,400 --> 00:18:13,760
How could she do this to me?

327
00:18:13,760 --> 00:18:15,100
Do you see it now?

328
00:18:15,500 --> 00:18:16,930
That family...

329
00:18:17,230 --> 00:18:20,270
is a heartless bunch
without a shred of decency.

330
00:18:21,210 --> 00:18:22,670
No matter how I look at it,

331
00:18:24,170 --> 00:18:27,680
they're not the ones
who can help you. Jin Ju is.

332
00:18:28,510 --> 00:18:31,720
So get down on your knees
and beg Jin Ju to help you.

333
00:18:31,720 --> 00:18:33,950
- Just please.
- Are you crazy?

334
00:18:34,490 --> 00:18:35,990
Why should I beg?

335
00:18:42,030 --> 00:18:43,030
Right.

336
00:18:44,900 --> 00:18:47,130
You couldn't even do
what I asked properly,

337
00:18:47,360 --> 00:18:48,870
and now you bring Baek Jin Ju here?

338
00:18:49,130 --> 00:18:51,000
What is it that you can actually do?

339
00:18:51,100 --> 00:18:52,870
Do you even want to help me?

340
00:18:52,870 --> 00:18:55,610
Choi Yu Na,
how can you talk to her like that?

341
00:18:56,640 --> 00:18:59,310
Jin Ju, I'm fine.

342
00:18:59,580 --> 00:19:02,510
Can you just look after my Yu Na?

343
00:19:03,710 --> 00:19:05,450
Please, I'm begging you.

344
00:19:09,090 --> 00:19:10,290
Why are you begging?

345
00:19:11,460 --> 00:19:13,760
Why are you groveling again
like you did seven years ago?

346
00:19:15,030 --> 00:19:17,130
Why do you think I tried
to get rid of her?

347
00:19:17,130 --> 00:19:19,630
It's because you and Dad
were always groveling...

348
00:19:19,860 --> 00:19:21,600
So why are you begging again?

349
00:19:22,500 --> 00:19:24,330
Because I have to save you.

350
00:19:24,770 --> 00:19:27,800
To find a way for my child to live,

351
00:19:27,870 --> 00:19:29,070
I have to beg.

352
00:19:29,140 --> 00:19:31,780
That's why you have
to beg Jin Ju too.

353
00:19:32,410 --> 00:19:34,650
This really is your last option.

354
00:19:47,560 --> 00:19:49,090
Just get lost.

355
00:19:49,660 --> 00:19:52,730
I'm never going to beg you,
so get out.

356
00:19:52,930 --> 00:19:54,570
Then who are you going to beg?

357
00:19:55,630 --> 00:19:57,270
Oh Jung Ran,
who's turned her back on you?

358
00:19:57,700 --> 00:20:00,540
Or Park Tae Ho, who's been cornered?

359
00:20:01,970 --> 00:20:03,240
He's cornered?

360
00:20:03,440 --> 00:20:06,880
We handed his slush fund ledger
to the prosecution.

361
00:20:07,240 --> 00:20:09,410
Park Tae Ho will be summoned
for questioning soon.

362
00:20:09,480 --> 00:20:11,150
As they investigate the slush fund,

363
00:20:12,220 --> 00:20:15,250
everything from seven years ago
will come to light.

364
00:20:15,850 --> 00:20:16,850
What?

365
00:20:16,850 --> 00:20:18,690
It's over now,

366
00:20:19,260 --> 00:20:20,520
so you might as well give up.

367
00:20:20,720 --> 00:20:23,690
Confess to your crimes
and pay the price.

368
00:20:23,860 --> 00:20:26,430
If you do,
I'll take care of your mother.

369
00:20:27,030 --> 00:20:28,170
Shut it.

370
00:20:29,570 --> 00:20:32,440
It can't end like this.
This is ridiculous.

371
00:20:33,440 --> 00:20:36,440
My life can't end here like this.

372
00:20:39,340 --> 00:20:40,810
This is all your fault.

373
00:20:41,240 --> 00:20:44,150
Baek Jin Ju. You ruined everything!

374
00:20:45,180 --> 00:20:47,050
You ruined it, Baek Jin Ju.

375
00:20:48,150 --> 00:20:49,250
Baek Jin Ju,

376
00:20:49,550 --> 00:20:52,960
I'm in this mess because of you.
It's all your fault!

377
00:20:53,060 --> 00:20:54,460
Let go!

378
00:20:59,900 --> 00:21:00,960
Choi Yu Na.

379
00:21:03,030 --> 00:21:04,230
You're the one...

380
00:21:04,940 --> 00:21:06,440
who ruined your own life.

381
00:21:07,570 --> 00:21:10,940
If you can't admit to your mistakes
or reflect on them,

382
00:21:11,740 --> 00:21:13,380
you'll only fall further.

383
00:21:15,610 --> 00:21:16,850
Is hitting rock bottom like this...

384
00:21:17,680 --> 00:21:19,250
the price you're paying
for your sins?

385
00:21:42,710 --> 00:21:44,840
(Stock Gift Agreement)

386
00:21:46,280 --> 00:21:49,650
He'll just give up
the chairmanship instead?

387
00:21:50,510 --> 00:21:53,020
If Hyun Jun gives up
the chairmanship,

388
00:21:53,080 --> 00:21:54,250
I don't have a backup plan.

389
00:21:54,720 --> 00:21:57,220
There's no one else
I can trust with it.

390
00:21:58,790 --> 00:22:01,760
Kim Dan Hui, Moon Tae Jin,
and Baek Jin Ju.

391
00:22:02,390 --> 00:22:05,800
The three of them will pounce
and come after Adele Group.

392
00:22:16,770 --> 00:22:20,240
Adele Group is my life's work.

393
00:22:21,480 --> 00:22:24,110
There's no way
I'm letting anyone take it.

394
00:22:39,930 --> 00:22:44,900
(Stock Gift Agreement)

395
00:22:45,840 --> 00:22:49,110
(August 3, 2026, Park Tae Ho)

396
00:22:54,080 --> 00:22:55,080
Father.

397
00:22:57,180 --> 00:22:59,450
I'm only handing over my shares...

398
00:22:59,820 --> 00:23:02,320
to protect
the chairmanship of Adele.

399
00:23:04,390 --> 00:23:07,820
Kim Dan Hui, Moon Tae Jin,
Baek Jin Ju,

400
00:23:09,390 --> 00:23:10,560
and even Park Min Jun.

401
00:23:11,900 --> 00:23:14,260
Don't let any of them
take it from you.

402
00:23:14,330 --> 00:23:15,570
Secure the position.

403
00:23:17,730 --> 00:23:18,840
Don't worry.

404
00:23:19,400 --> 00:23:23,170
If you lose your position
or turn on me,

405
00:23:24,510 --> 00:23:26,410
you'd better brace yourself.

406
00:23:26,980 --> 00:23:29,350
Of course. You can count on me.

407
00:23:56,170 --> 00:23:58,340
Why are you so happy this morning?

408
00:23:59,010 --> 00:24:01,850
It's the day Chairman Park
is being summoned for questioning.

409
00:24:02,650 --> 00:24:04,350
Hyun Jun has it all now.

410
00:24:04,710 --> 00:24:06,780
The chairmanship,
the stocks, and the fortune.

411
00:24:07,050 --> 00:24:09,890
He has it all.

412
00:24:09,890 --> 00:24:11,350
And you're that happy about it?

413
00:24:11,690 --> 00:24:13,990
Every single one of those
is a heavy burden.

414
00:24:14,360 --> 00:24:16,430
Hyun Jun has to carry all of that...

415
00:24:17,030 --> 00:24:18,630
and live his life protecting it.

416
00:24:18,760 --> 00:24:21,030
A crown is meant to be heavy.

417
00:24:21,430 --> 00:24:23,370
That's why not just anyone
can wear it.

418
00:24:34,280 --> 00:24:36,110
I'm going to escort Father now.

419
00:24:36,410 --> 00:24:39,680
While I'm gone, don't stir up
any unnecessary trouble,

420
00:24:40,080 --> 00:24:41,350
and stay put.

421
00:24:41,520 --> 00:24:44,150
Of course. Don't you worry.

422
00:24:45,290 --> 00:24:46,890
To make it look like
you really passed out,

423
00:24:48,590 --> 00:24:49,590
get in this.

424
00:25:10,480 --> 00:25:12,820
We've finally made it this far.

425
00:25:13,420 --> 00:25:15,450
We'll get to see Park Tae Ho
face justice...

426
00:25:16,150 --> 00:25:17,920
and finally get arrested.

427
00:25:18,920 --> 00:25:21,490
Yes, today is just the beginning.

428
00:25:21,890 --> 00:25:24,130
The investigation is starting
with the slush fund ledger,

429
00:25:24,790 --> 00:25:26,860
but they'll also investigate
the case from seven years ago,

430
00:25:27,400 --> 00:25:30,370
and what happened 30 years ago
will be brought up too.

431
00:25:30,970 --> 00:25:33,640
That's right.
All of Park Tae Ho's evil deeds...

432
00:25:34,240 --> 00:25:36,610
are part of a long,
interconnected chain.

433
00:25:36,910 --> 00:25:38,340
Once Park Tae Ho goes down,

434
00:25:38,610 --> 00:25:41,280
Choi Yu Na and Oh Jung Ran
will face justice too.

435
00:25:43,550 --> 00:25:45,320
Shall we go, then?

436
00:25:51,290 --> 00:25:53,020
- Chairman Park has arrived.
- He's here.

437
00:25:53,090 --> 00:25:54,090
It's Park Tae Ho.

438
00:25:57,330 --> 00:25:59,800
Do you admit to the slush fund
and bribery charges?

439
00:25:59,860 --> 00:26:01,030
We hear the entire slush fund ledger
was handed over.

440
00:26:01,030 --> 00:26:02,130
Do you have a comment?

441
00:26:02,170 --> 00:26:03,670
What will happen to the Adele Group?

442
00:26:03,670 --> 00:26:05,400
Will you take responsibility
for this management risk?

443
00:26:05,400 --> 00:26:07,540
- Please, just one comment.
- Is it true?

444
00:26:07,600 --> 00:26:08,910
Do you have anything to say?

445
00:26:09,010 --> 00:26:10,140
Is it true?

446
00:26:10,210 --> 00:26:12,240
- Please give us a comment.
- Please give us a comment.

447
00:26:12,340 --> 00:26:14,980
Park Tae Ho,
former chairman of Adele Group,

448
00:26:15,050 --> 00:26:16,450
has arrived
for prosecutorial questioning...

449
00:26:16,510 --> 00:26:18,050
over allegations
of slush funds and bribery.

450
00:26:18,320 --> 00:26:20,250
The prosecution has announced
an intensive investigation.

451
00:26:20,250 --> 00:26:22,350
It's been reported that
they will request an arrest warrant,

452
00:26:22,620 --> 00:26:24,990
making it seem increasingly likely
that Chairman Park will be arrested.

453
00:26:25,490 --> 00:26:27,590
Is Chairman Park being investigated
by the prosecution?

454
00:26:28,020 --> 00:26:29,030
Keep it down.

455
00:26:32,460 --> 00:26:34,430
If everything comes out
and he's arrested,

456
00:26:34,800 --> 00:26:35,800
what will happen to me?

457
00:26:36,970 --> 00:26:39,700
Is there really no one
who can save me?

458
00:26:50,680 --> 00:26:52,250
My father is not in good health,

459
00:26:52,750 --> 00:26:54,050
so I will be answering questions
on his behalf.

460
00:26:55,250 --> 00:26:58,220
First, I'd like
to sincerely apologize once again...

461
00:26:59,220 --> 00:27:00,960
for the concern
this situation has caused.

462
00:27:11,630 --> 00:27:12,640
Park Hyun Jun.

463
00:27:13,200 --> 00:27:15,140
Is he trying to protect Park Tae Ho
to the very end?

464
00:27:15,870 --> 00:27:17,970
He's going to live as the chairman
of the Adele Group.

465
00:27:18,980 --> 00:27:20,140
It seems he's made up his mind.

466
00:27:24,680 --> 00:27:28,150
Furthermore, right here and now,

467
00:27:30,590 --> 00:27:32,160
I'd like to announce...

468
00:27:32,890 --> 00:27:34,520
my resignation
as chairman of Adele Group.

469
00:27:35,930 --> 00:27:38,530
- What? He's resigning?
- What is he talking about?

470
00:27:39,800 --> 00:27:41,160
Are you resigning as chairman?

471
00:27:41,160 --> 00:27:42,770
Why the sudden decision?

472
00:27:42,770 --> 00:27:44,630
Is this how
you're taking responsibility?

473
00:27:44,670 --> 00:27:46,100
Then what happens
to the Adele Group?

474
00:27:46,100 --> 00:27:47,300
Who will be the next chairman?

475
00:27:47,570 --> 00:27:49,870
- Please give us a comment.
- Who will be the next chairman?

476
00:27:50,410 --> 00:27:52,480
- So what happens now?
- Is there another candidate?

477
00:27:52,540 --> 00:27:53,740
What is your reason for doing this?

478
00:27:55,310 --> 00:27:58,650
What's all this nonsense
about you stepping down as chairman?

479
00:27:59,680 --> 00:28:02,420
Did you forget the condition I set
when I gave you...

480
00:28:02,750 --> 00:28:04,150
my shares and assets?

481
00:28:05,020 --> 00:28:06,020
Right.

482
00:28:06,790 --> 00:28:10,830
Now that it's all mine,
I realized I overlooked one detail.

483
00:28:11,590 --> 00:28:14,300
I'm not qualified
to be chairman of Adele Group.

484
00:28:17,270 --> 00:28:18,370
You're not qualified?

485
00:28:18,940 --> 00:28:20,040
The reason...

486
00:28:25,710 --> 00:28:27,540
I'm resigning as chairman...

487
00:28:29,380 --> 00:28:31,920
is because I'm not
Chairman Park's biological son.

488
00:28:32,120 --> 00:28:33,880
What? He's not his biological son?

489
00:28:34,420 --> 00:28:36,350
- Then who's his real father?
- Is that really true?

490
00:28:36,350 --> 00:28:37,490
Who's your biological father?

491
00:28:38,020 --> 00:28:39,260
Who is your biological father?

492
00:28:39,660 --> 00:28:41,120
Why are you only revealing this now?

493
00:28:47,030 --> 00:28:48,030
What did you just say?

494
00:28:48,600 --> 00:28:50,270
Hyun Jun is resigning as chairman?

495
00:28:50,670 --> 00:28:52,170
But why?

496
00:28:52,940 --> 00:28:54,170
In front of everyone,

497
00:28:56,010 --> 00:28:57,570
he announced it himself.

498
00:28:59,780 --> 00:29:01,510
That he isn't Park Tae Ho's son.

499
00:29:03,250 --> 00:29:06,420
What the heck are you talking about?

500
00:29:11,420 --> 00:29:12,460
Park Hyun Jun, you...

501
00:29:13,460 --> 00:29:14,590
This was your plan all along.

502
00:29:18,260 --> 00:29:19,360
All the way to the end,

503
00:29:19,800 --> 00:29:22,430
I'll be right beside Park Tae Ho.

504
00:29:23,770 --> 00:29:26,070
While proudly by his side,

505
00:29:27,670 --> 00:29:29,740
I'll show you the choice I've made.

506
00:29:30,940 --> 00:29:31,940
Baek Jin Ju,

507
00:29:33,710 --> 00:29:34,910
this is my choice.

508
00:29:40,950 --> 00:29:43,050
- Park Hyun Jun!
- Wasn't he ill?

509
00:29:43,390 --> 00:29:45,520
- Is your leg all right?
- What is this nonsense?

510
00:29:46,460 --> 00:29:48,360
What do you mean you're not my son?

511
00:29:48,860 --> 00:29:52,100
This is no place
to be pulling a stunt like this.

512
00:29:52,330 --> 00:29:54,160
Even if I had lost my mind,

513
00:29:55,060 --> 00:29:56,730
I wouldn't joke about
something like this.

514
00:29:57,470 --> 00:29:58,900
Chairman Park Tae Ho,

515
00:30:00,270 --> 00:30:02,010
I'm not your biological son.

516
00:30:03,710 --> 00:30:05,280
Once you're done being questioned,

517
00:30:05,940 --> 00:30:08,850
the son who promised
to protect the chairmanship,

518
00:30:09,150 --> 00:30:11,750
along with all your shares
and assets...

519
00:30:13,580 --> 00:30:14,580
will be gone.

520
00:30:15,150 --> 00:30:16,620
Park Hyun Jun...

521
00:30:16,820 --> 00:30:18,250
All you have left now...

522
00:30:21,160 --> 00:30:23,160
is a mountain of regret...

523
00:30:24,260 --> 00:30:25,800
and your punishment.

524
00:30:28,730 --> 00:30:30,230
Enjoy paying your dues,

525
00:30:31,830 --> 00:30:34,540
Chairman Park Tae Ho.

526
00:30:36,840 --> 00:30:37,840
This can't be happening.

527
00:30:39,110 --> 00:30:41,840
Hyun Jun, how could you?

528
00:30:43,750 --> 00:30:46,620
I won't let you get away with this.
You and Oh Jung Ran.

529
00:30:47,880 --> 00:30:51,620
I'm going to destroy you
with my own two hands.

530
00:30:56,830 --> 00:30:58,290
Whatever it takes!

531
00:31:24,150 --> 00:31:26,960
(Pearl in Red)

532
00:31:27,120 --> 00:31:29,860
Kim Dan Hui,
you set this up too, didn't you?

533
00:31:29,930 --> 00:31:33,000
Is this pathetic little stunt
what you call revenge?

534
00:31:33,560 --> 00:31:35,470
I hope I'm overthinking this,

535
00:31:35,470 --> 00:31:38,970
but I'm worried about
what Park Tae Ho might be plotting.

536
00:31:39,170 --> 00:31:40,170
Ms. Oh...

537
00:31:40,800 --> 00:31:43,070
You tore my life to shreds
without a second thought for me.

538
00:31:43,070 --> 00:31:45,340
How could you do this? How?

539
00:31:45,810 --> 00:31:47,810
(Subtitles are provided by KOCOWA.)
